1691 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 407 0 R
/T (Power cardio is training for explosive Power. Training for Power is similiar to training for Speed, we try to lift very fast. However, when we train for speed we lift as fast as we can with no resistance to slow us down. Training for Power means we lift as fast as we can with weights added into the mix. )
/E (Power cardio is training for explosive Power. Training for Power is similiar to training for Speed, we try to lift very fast. However, when we train for speed we lift as fast as we can with no resistance to slow us down. Training for Power means we lift as fast as we can with weights added into the mix. )
/Pg 65 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
