<<
/Title (If Boxing is not your thing, then your aim of this month is to go and try a new sport for at least 30minutes to an hour on your cardio days. You can run around shooting  Basketball hoops, give Rock Climbing  a try or go to a Swimming lesson. The aim is to find a form of cardio you genuinely enjoy, because then you will never have an issue sticking to cardio in your programming again.)
